<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT VENEZUELA 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT VENEZUELA 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Venezuela 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a Copa America first round group B match on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Milton Coimbra (60th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 13,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Bolivia	   1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p> Peru		1  1  0  0  1  0  3</p>
<p> Uruguay	   1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p> Venezuela	 1  0  0  1  0  1  0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams plus the two third-placed teams with</p>
<p>the best overall records qualify for the quarter-finals.</p>
</text>
